    "sub_title": "下水道工程",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "1.污水收集。2.收集系統規劃。3.汙水處理單元。4.汙水處理設計。5.汙水排放。",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "衛生工程規劃實務",
    "sub_ename": "SANITARY ENGINEERING PLANNING APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "下水道工程是台灣近年水利工程的重點發展項目，本課程所教授的衛生工程包含雨水下水道及污水下水道，課程內容包含下水道工程的認識、管線評估與設計及相關軟體的應用，可提供學生下水道工程規劃設計的觀念及能力。",
    "describe_eh": " The sanitary engineering course includes water supply engineering and sewer engineering. In water supply engineering, theory introduction includes water law, quality index, transportation, treatment and distribution. Sewer engineering includes theory introduction and practical sides with sewage law, quality, sewer collection, sewage treatment, planning and design and the application of sewer engineering planning software.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解衛生工程近年及未來發展趨勢",
      "describe_en": "To Introduce the development trend of sanitary engineering in Taiwan"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解衛生工程的規劃理念\t",
      "describe_en": "To learn the planning concept of sanitary engineering"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解衛生工程的設計過程\t",
      "describe_en": "To learn the application of sanitary engineering software"
    }
  ],
